<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10156" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">conflātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		conflo. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A fanning, kindling, stirring up</i> (late Lat.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Prop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fornacis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hier. adv. Jov. 1</span></i>
			, n. 1.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Esp., <i>a casting, moulding</i> in metal,
				<i><span class="en">Vulg.
				Jer. 51, 17</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fidei,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Fug. Pers. 3</span></i>
			.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> = inflatio, <i><span class="en">Cael.
				Aur. Tard. 5, 2, 36</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
